  // --- STEP 3: MAGNIFICENT ARCHING SICKLE & TAIL FEATHERS ---
  // Drawn from back/lowest rectrices to front/highest grand sickles
  // Each plume is individually barbed with iridescent Prussian-azure, sable, bronze & ochre-gold!
